{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55231","headline":"梦中献南楚国王夜宴诗（题拟） · 史松","name":"梦中献南楚国王夜宴诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙乐佳人数步随，殿堂高敞盛威仪。\n凤笙品弄檀唇散，鼍鼓喧鍧锦袖垂。\n宝帐珍华光煦灼，玳筵花烛影参差。\n酒酣回顾清歌妓。\n粉面皆言某在斯。\n（《灯下闲谈》卷下《梦与神交》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}